designs/flash_soc/rtl/ibex_nogate.v is Ibex converted to Verilog with sv2v, with the generic clock gate removed.

IHP-Open-PDK, https://github.com/IHP-GmbH/IHP-Open-PDK, commit 5e6d592e4002946a4616f798c357f0f3c06cf3b6.
Copyright IHP GmbH.
ihp/rc/sg13g2_typ.itf is IHP's wire model with one duplicate layer name changed. The models in
ihp/rc/rcmax and ihp/rc/rcmin are derived from it and from IHP's process specification; see ihp/rc/DERIVATION.md.
setup/get_pdk.sh downloads the kit and derives a fill macro and an SRAM LEF from it; the kit itself is not
included here.

No Synopsys or Ansys files are included. setup/build_libs.sh builds the libraries those tools read from IHP's
kit, with the user's own licenses.
